<view class="container">
  <text class="eyebrow">DEEPSEEK · 陪聊人设定制</text>
  <text class="title">让每一种陪伴，都有专属的温度</text>
  <view class="subtitle">只需选择，无需填写。把你期待的性格、相处方式和故事，交给设计师细细描绘。</view>
  <view class="notice">{{backendEnabled ? "云端申请 · 暂不收费 · 自动生成后人工审核交付" : "本地演示 · 不收款 · 下载人数与收藏仅为本机统计"}}</view>
  <view class="section">免费角色卡 <text class="muted">FREE COLLECTION</text></view>
  <view class="subtitle">先遇见一个喜欢的角色。免费查看并复制，用于你的陪聊设定。</view>
  <input class="search" placeholder="搜索角色名称、标签或简介" value="{{search}}" bindinput="search" />
  <scroll-view scroll-x class="category-strip"><button class="chip {{!category ? 'selected' : ''}}" bindtap="category" data-category="">全部</button><button wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{category === item ? 'selected' : ''}}" bindtap="category" data-category="{{item}}">{{item}}</button></scroll-view>
  <view class="row"><button class="{{sort === 'new' ? 'primary' : 'secondary'}}" bindtap="sort" data-sort="new">最新上架</button><button class="{{sort === 'hot' ? 'primary' : 'secondary'}}" bindtap="sort" data-sort="hot">热度排行</button><button class="{{favorites ? 'primary' : 'secondary'}}" bindtap="favorites">我的收藏</button></view>
  <view class="muted">热度按下载人数×2＋收藏数排序；同一用户重复下载只计一次。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!freeCards.length &amp;&amp; !loading}}" class="card muted">暂无匹配角色，试试其他分类或关键词。</view>
  <view class="card free-card" wx:for="{{freeCards}}" wx:key="id">
    <image wx:if="{{item.cover}}" class="cover" src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill" /><view wx:else class="avatar">{{item.symbol}}</view><view class="badge">免费 · {{item.tag}}</view>
    <view class="section">{{item.name}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{item.intro}}</view>
    <view class="muted">{{item.category}} · {{item.downloads}} 人下载 · {{item.favorites}} 人收藏</view><button class="text-button" bindtap="favorite" data-id="{{item.id}}">{{item.favorite ? "♥ 已收藏" : "♡ 收藏角色"}}</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="viewCard" data-id="{{item.id}}">查看角色卡</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{activeCard}}"><view class="section">{{activeCard.name}} · 免费人设卡</view><view class="card-content">{{activeCard.card}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="copyCard">免费复制角色卡</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="download">下载人设文本文件</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="closeCard">收起</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="muted">正在载入角色…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{hasMore}}" class="muted">继续向下滚动加载更多</view>
  <view class="section">专属定制 <text class="muted">MADE FOR YOU</text></view>
  <view class="subtitle">50题 ¥{{packages[0].price}} / 100题 ¥{{packages[1].price}}。私人不公开定制按基础价的1.5倍计算，可在提交前选择。</view>
  <view class="card" wx:for="{{packages}}" wx:key="id">
    <view class="badge">{{item.count}} 个选择，描绘你的理想角色</view>
    <view class="section">{{item.name}}</view>
    <view class="subtitle">{{item.description}}</view>
    <view class="price">¥{{item.price}} <text class="muted">配置参考价 · 演示不支付</text></view>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="begin" data-id="{{item.id}}">开始 / 继续定制</button>
  </view>
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <button class="secondary" bindtap="orders">我的定制申请 / 订单</button>
  <view class="muted">{{backendEnabled ? "草稿保存在本机，提交后申请保存在服务器；普通成品默认公开，私人不公开。" : "草稿与订单仅保存在本机，清除缓存后丢失。"}}每题均可交由设计师决定。</view>
</view>
